<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the Spanish first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Atletico Madrid 1 (Juan Eduardo Esnaider 22nd minute) Racing Santander 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance 40,000.</p>
<p>Sporting Gijon 0 Real Madrid 1 (Fernando Hierro 19th minute). 0-1. 21,000.</p>
<p>Valencia 2 (Valery Karpin 22nd, Inaki Hurtado 92nd) Celta Vigo 0. 1-0. 41,000.</p>
<p>Tenerife 1 (Pablo Paz 64th) Rayo Vallecano 2 (Angel Alcazar 66th, 83rd). 0-0. 10,000.</p>
